        "content": "## MLOps Alerts Overview\n\nCentral operational dashboard showing all active alert states, drift detection, model performance, API health, and service probe status.\n\n### Section Guide\n| Section | Purpose |\n|:--------|:--------|\n| \ud83d\udd14 Active Alerts | Live Alertmanager alert list \u2014 firing and resolved alerts |\n| \ud83d\udcca Drift Detection | Data drift and concept drift gauge states |\n| \ud83d\udcc8 Prediction Distribution | Healthy vs faulty prediction rates and label breakdown |\n| \ud83c\udfaf Model Accuracy & Confidence | Current model accuracy and prediction confidence P50 |\n| \u26a1 API Performance | Error rate, P95 latency, and endpoint request rates |\n| \ud83d\udd27 Retraining & Registry | Retraining trigger counts and A/B model version split |\n| \ud83c\udf10 Service Health Probes | HTTP probe results for Nginx, Airflow, MLflow Buffer |\n\n**Data sources:** Prometheus (metrics), Alertmanager (alert states), cAdvisor (container), postgres_exporter (database)\n\n*Last updated: Session 10 \u2014 Sprint 1\u20134 complete*",
